    "text": "Let F be an infinite field or a skew-field.\n   a) Find all transitive subgroups of P GL(2, F ) acting on the projective line F ∪{∞}.\n   c) What are the flag-transitive subgroups of P GL(d + 1, F )?\n   d) What subgroups of P GL(d + 1, F ) are 2-transitive on the points of P G(d, F )?\n                                                           P. M. Neumann, C. E. Praeger",
